  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a title=\"Applied Cooking 連結\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/applied-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/%E6%AA%A2%E8%A6%96%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%A8%A1%E7%B5%84%20%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%A3%E6%8E%A5%20Applied%20Energistics%202%20%E5%92%8C%20Cooking%20for%20Blockheads-%E5%BA%95%E9%83%A8%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90-edbd7e?labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Applied Cooking 宣傳\" width=\"845\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a title=\"Refined Cooking 連結\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/refined-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/%E6%AA%A2%E8%A6%96%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E6%A8%A1%E7%B5%84%20%EF%BC%9A%E9%80%A3%E6%8E%A5%20Refined%20Storage%20%E5%92%8C%20Cooking%20for%20Blockheads-%E5%BA%95%E9%83%A8%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90-e78a4e?labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Refined Cooking 宣傳\" width=\"800\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><a title=\"MelonCube 合作夥伴連結\" href=\"https://meloncube.net/sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://www.meloncube.net/partners/custom-banners/f22247d3-fc0d-404f-a8b1-0ad4d5aca331.png\" alt=\"MelonCube 合作夥伴橫幅\" width=\"900\" height=\"158\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/%E6%94%AF%E6%8F%B4%20Forge-1.19%20%7C%201.18-800000?labelColor=FFA500&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Minecraft 版本徽章\" width=\"266\" height=\"28\" /> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%9D%E6%96%BC-%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B6%E7%AB%AF%20%26%20%E4%BC%BA%E6%9C%8D%E5%99%A8-800000?labelColor=FFA500&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Applied Cooking 安裝徽章\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<h2>描述</h2>\n<p>這是一個為所有 Sebastrn 模組提供的共用函式庫專案。</p>\n<p>我計劃為我的模組同時支援 Forge 和 Fabric（目前我只支援 Forge）。</p>\n<p>這個函式庫模組將作為我所有模組所需的共用程式碼起點（工具方法、抽象層、介面等）。</p>\n<p>此外，這個模組還加入了一本指南書（使用 Patchouli 建置），為我的所有模組提供說明，幫助玩家入門。</p>\n<p>我不建議任何人以此為基礎進行開發，因為我不會提供文件，而且會根據模組需求大幅改動內容。</p>\n<h2>社群平台</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a title=\"Sebastrn 的 Curseforge\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/itssebastrn/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=ItsSebastrn&color=800000&labelColor=FFA500&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Curseforge\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\" /></a> <a title=\"Sebastrn 的 Modrinth\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Sebastrn&color=800000&labelColor=FFA500&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Modrinth\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\" style=\"max-height: 28px;\" /></a> <a title=\"Sebastrn 的 Twitter\" href=\"https://twitter.com/ItsSebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@ItsSebastrn&color=800000&labelColor=FFA500&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Twitter\" width=\"159\" height=\"28\" /></a> <a title=\"Sebastrn 的 Youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC46TYUp8WpcFub8NxuGA66A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Sebastrn&color=800000&labelColor=ffa500&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Youtube\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\" /></a> <a title=\"Sebastrn 的 Twitch\" href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/itssebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=ItsSebastrn&color=800000&labelColor=ffa500&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitch&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Twitch\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\" /></a> <a title=\"Sebastrn 的 Github\" href=\"https://github.com/Sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Sebastrn&color=800000&labelColor=ffa500&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Github\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a title=\"Applied Cooking 連結\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/applied-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_ACLink.png\" alt=\"Applied Cooking 宣傳\" width=\"1808\" height=\"268\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a title=\"Refined Cooking 連結\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/refined-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Applied_Cooking/BH_AC_RCLink.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking 宣傳\" width=\"1808\" height=\"268\" /></a></p>",
